{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51731","headline":"夏雨登干霄亭上宋使君（二首） 二 · 贯休","name":"夏雨登干霄亭上宋使君（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邹鲁封疆禾稼浓，清吟孤坐思重重。\n新诗几献蓬莱客，远梦仍归菡萏峯。\n野果一枝堪荐茗，落霞数片欲烧松。\n如何深得冥搜癖，月磬声声归去慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}